sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client (app/JS)
    participant R as Router (/api/v1)
    participant Ctrl as Api::V1::ProductsController
    participant Ser as Serializer (Jbuilder)
    participant DB as Database
    C->>R: GET /api/v1/products (Accept: application/json)
    R->>Ctrl: index
    Ctrl->>DB: Product.all
    DB-->>Ctrl: records
    Ctrl->>Ser: render json
    Ser-->>C: 200 JSON [{id, name, price}]
    Note over C,Ser: REST — server quyết field trả về<br/>GraphQL — client tự chọn field cần
